cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
title: "Superior Tips settled picks: Top picks, Daily Accumulator and VIP"
abstract: >-
  An append-only record of the picks Superior Tips puts in front of readers to play: the daily Top
  picks (rank 1 is the Bet of the Day), the Daily Accumulator and the VIP channel. Every pick is
  locked before kickoff and graded after the final whistle, wins and losses both: kickoff,
  competition, teams, the pick as published, its price, the printed chance, the final score and the
  grade.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Superior Football Desk
    website: https://superiortips.com
    email: contact@superiortips.com
repository-code: https://github.com/st0jka/superior-tips-predictions-dataset
url: https://superiortips.com
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - football
  - soccer
  - basketball
  - prediction
  - forecast evaluation
  - sports analytics
